---
import InfoCallout from "../../components/InfoCallout.astro";
import ReferenceBrowser from "../../components/ReferenceBrowser.astro";
import PageShell from "../../layouts/PageShell.astro";

const headings = [
  { depth: 2, slug: "catalogue", text: "Item catalogue" },
  { depth: 2, slug: "categories", text: "Included categories" },
  { depth: 2, slug: "progression-items", text: "Progression-linked items" },
];
---

<PageShell
  title="Items"
  description="Search Cobbleverse fossils, materials, mints, mulch, plates, and progression items."
  category="Items"
  hero="/assets/sections/art-structures.webp"
  {headings}
  verified
  lastUpdated="2026-11-01"
  related={[
    { href: "/battle/shops/", title: "Shop Browser" },
    { href: "/progression/legendary-mythical/", title: "Legendary Routes" },
    { href: "/worlds/structures/", title: "Structures" },
  ]}
>
  <h2 id="catalogue">Item catalogue</h2>
  <p>
    Search by item name, category, purpose, or acquisition term. Each record
    preserves the source category and indexed description. This is a summary
    catalogue; full acquisition procedures and recipes are linked from the
    relevant guides.
  </p>
  <ReferenceBrowser
    kind="item"
    source="/data/cobbleverse-guides/reference-index.json"
    placeholder="Galar Particle, fossil, mint, plate…"
  />
  <h2 id="categories">Included categories</h2>
  <div class="field-model">
    <div>
      <strong>Fossils</strong><span
        >Ancient remains revived into prehistoric Pokémon.</span
      >
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>Mints</strong><span
        >Consumables that change the effective stat nature.</span
      >
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>Mulch</strong><span
        >Berry-growing and soil-management materials.</span
      >
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>Plates</strong><span
        >Type-linked collectibles used by Arceus progression.</span
      >
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>Materials</strong><span
        >Locator, shrine, assembly, and encounter components.</span
      >
    </div>
  </div>
  <h2 id="progression-items">Progression-linked items</h2>
  <InfoCallout title="Check the exact route">
    <p>
      Similar relics, wings, gems, and orbs are not interchangeable. Confirm the
      item name and the encounter order before spending or placing it. Eternatus
      requires 500 Galar Particles; Arceus requires all 18 plates; Zygarde Cells
      and Cores are loaded into a Cube before the Reassembly Unit is used.
    </p>
  </InfoCallout>
</PageShell>
